          "title": "You'll want to know: حالت",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "حالت — hālat — \"a state (of health, of repair)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اگر مریض کی حالت ٹھیک نہیں تو ہسپتال لے جائیے۔ agar marīz kī hālat ṭhīk nahīṅ to haspatāl le jāiye. If the patient is not well, take him to hospital."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "حالت (hālat) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic ḥāla, \"a state, a condition\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
